    <briefdescription>
<para>Automatic transaction retry manager with exponential backoff. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implements automatic retry logic for database transactions with:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Exponential backoff with jitter to prevent thundering herd</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Circuit breaker to prevent wasted retries</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Error classification (retryable vs non-retryable)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Comprehensive metrics tracking</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Thread-safe for concurrent use.</para>
<para>Example: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1storage_1_1_transaction_retry_manager_1ac6879c30b9df0b415828ec256af0848b" kindref="member">TransactionRetryManager</ref><sp/>manager(config);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>result<sp/>=<sp/>manager.executeWithRetry([&amp;]()<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">return</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>database.executeTransaction(tx);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">},<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;user_update&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
